  "criteria": {
    "L1-A": "behavioural difference of the learned score: compare the two GREEDY outputs only. Go requires a unit where the plan_hash differs and BOTH plans are anchor-preserving and pass the shared reference check, produced under the same allowed set, the same tie-break, the same per-side budget and the same shared interface, and the whole package reproduces bit for bit on a second run",
