    "L1-B": "coverage by the non-learned search: is the MaskCO-greedy output inside the distance-SGBS completion set? Full coverage forbids an \"irreplaceable search value\" claim but does NOT retract the observed L1-A fact; uncovered legal plans only justify further investigation and never a quality claim",
